  "goodToKnow": "Die Verbrennung is burning or combustion (der Verbrennungsmotor, combustion engine) and a burn injury: Verbrennungen ersten Grades. The EU's planned phase-out of new Verbrenner cars from 2035 is hotly debated in car-loving Germany. On 10 May 1933, Nazi students held Bücherverbrennungen of books by Jewish and left-wing authors; a sunken library memorial marks the spot in Berlin's Bebelplatz. Plural: die Verbrennungen."
